{"product_id":"z100-smart-glasses-prescription-inserts","title":"Vuzix Z100® Smart Glasses Prescription Inserts","description":"\u003cdiv data-region=\"main\" data-shogun-variant-id=\"645b9e9dd273e1011bc673f9\" data-shogun-platform-type=\"shopify\" data-shogun-page-version-id=\"645b9e9dd273e1011bc673f2\" data-shogun-page-id=\"637cf5e89da50f00d067b8c6\" data-shogun-site-id=\"85aa81c4-d7e3-4cf8-be8d-146bd5bdf5ab\" data-shogun-id=\"637cf5e89da50f00d067b8c6\" class=\"shogun-root\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"shg-c\" id=\"s-b29ffd64-2af4-4839-8f0f-9299291a103e\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"shg-rich-text shg-theme-text-content\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDo it yourself kit to change the lenses on your Vuzix Z100 smart glasses. Comes with manufactured lenses made from your prescription.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e* Prescription Kit does not come with Vuzix Z100 smart glasses. Vuzix Z100 smart glasses will need to be added separately.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 30px;\"\u003e* The Prescription Kit will be shipped within 4-6 weeks of your order date. The Vuzix Z100 smart glasses and Prescription Kit Inserts will be shipped to you in 2 separate shipments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca data-mce-fragment=\"1\" href=\"\/pages\/prescription-measurement-guide\" title=\"Prescription Lens Installation Guide\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eFind Out How To Enter Your Prescription\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44669702799526,"sku":"515T0A001","price":149.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/Z100-Untinted-Press_Release_46ce391b-b5df-4ef7-949f-f2ce8da3c4c1.png?v=1706203126","url":"https:\/\/www.vuzix.com\/products\/z100-smart-glasses-prescription-inserts","provider":"Vuzix Corporation","version":"1.0","type":"link"}